<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 1.5 bln Ffr Nov 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 1.5 bln Ffr Nov 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>joint lead managers Merrill Lynch Finance SA, BNP and Credit</p>
<p>Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    25.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.89     PAY DATE  S 29.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    99.89     SPREAD	+32 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OAT 8.50 NOV 2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
